    "zipball_url": "https://api.github.com/repos/SkiTemplar/ultron/zipball/v15.5.9",
    "body": "Automated release built from tag `v15.5.9`.\n\n**Three install paths:**\n\n* **Windows desktop app** — download `ULTRON Control Center_*_x64-setup.exe`\n  (NSIS) or `*_x64_en-US.msi` and run it. No Git required. On first launch\n  Windows SmartScreen may warn that the publisher is unverified — this\n  is expected for unsigned releases. Click \"More info\" → \"Run anyway\".\n\n* **Linux desktop app** ⚠️ *unverified — looking for testers* —\n  download the `.AppImage` (universal: `chmod +x` and run) or the\n  `.deb` (`sudo dpkg -i …`). The CI matrix builds green on\n  ubuntu-22.04 but the author has not end-to-end tested an actual\n  Linux install yet. Please open an issue with distro + version + log\n  if you try it.\n\n* **Full system** (skills, agents, hooks, cockpit scripts) — one-liner:\n  * Windows: `iwr -useb https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SkiTemplar/ultron/main/bootstrap.ps1 | iex`\n  * Linux:   `curl -fsSL https://raw.githubusercontent.com/SkiTemplar/ultron/main/bootstrap.sh | bash`\n\n  Either downloads `ultron-system-*.zip` from this release, verifies\n  the SHA-256, extracts to `~/.ultron`, runs the matching `install.ps1`\n  / `install.sh`, and launches the Control Center installer.\n\nSee `docs/INSTALL.md` for full notes and `docs/RELEASE-PROCESS.md` for\nhow releases are produced."
  }
